actions.rationale:
The whole Underhang:
- the left cliff facility, carved from rock: the dock under a ledge, a ladder up, the ledge tunnel, a shaft to the facility and the power room (objective 1), a catwalk to cap 1;
- the right shore bunker: a catwalk and ladder from the last cap, the lower corridor, stairs to the upper corridor, a shaft to the basement (objective 3), a shaft to the hilltop (the extraction and a CS-4 Ranger);
- seven legs, rooms along the whole deck, enemies for both chunks, and two more patrols.
It carries cycle 2's fixes (ladders, objective clock, look, lamps). Staging lint: 0 violations, nothing unreachable, 3 objectives reachable, 7 caps with cover, bounds 0–15800.

The play probe for three chunks:
- the ladder test on cap 1's right end (its left end is now a catwalk);
- all three consoles held, then the hilltop extraction;
- overviews of the cliff and the bunker;
- eye-level shots of the facility, the ledge, the bunker's lower corridor and stairs, and the hilltop.
